 "_comment": "Shared cases for the ticket id rule. Read by backend/tests/test_work_ref_rule.py and cli/internal/api/workref_test.go. A case with repeat holds raw repeated that many times. The Go test skips length_depends_on_nfc (the CLI does not make the text composed) and invalid_python_only (Go text cannot hold a lone surrogate). A valid case with cli_refuses is cleaned by the backend, but the CLI refuses it on purpose: a control character at the end of a flag or variable value is most likely a mistake.",
